  "contentData": [
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "fe26a33e-9f64-4725-954d-dc75d53f5114",
      "udi": "umb://element/7aa07e7df4524b9182de7a38e75b45de"
    },
    {
      "backgroundColor": "",
      "backgroundColorOpacity": "1",
      "contentTypeKey": "4ac6dfe6-3e77-4ebb-b1d7-f73ee48847f4",
      "heading": "Programs for Individuals & Families",
      "highlightParagraph": "BEHF programs support parents in fostering deeper connections with their children, help individuals manage stress, anxiety & depression and provide guidance on navigating relationship challenges. We also offer strategies for effective time management, empowering individuals to cultivate inner peace and unlock their full potential.",
      "iconImage": [],
      "iconImageBigger": "0",
      "iconImageCaption": "",
      "iconImageOnRight": "0",
      "paragraph": {
        "markup": "<p>With the rise of hustle culture, it’s easy to feel disconnected, overwhelmed by stress, and unsure where to find personal clarity. While families strive to build deeper connections and a harmonious home, they also seek to nurture well-being without losing their sense of self.</p>\n<h3>Here’s what BEHF brings to individuals and Families:</h3>",
        "blocks": {
          "contentData": [],
          "settingsData": []
        }
      },
      "udi": "umb://element/ad24c7b476de479ab12f3aaeae64f8f9"
    },
    {
      "backgroundColor": "",
      "backgroundColorOpacity": "1",
      "contentTypeKey": "4ac6dfe6-3e77-4ebb-b1d7-f73ee48847f4",
      "heading": "Improve Emotional Well-Being",
      "highlightParagraph": "",
      "iconImage": [
        {
          "key": "4059cce1-3b53-43bc-a8b8-48a3009440c8",
          "mediaKey": "16206078-8f02-4eec-8ece-7dad8507ed22"
        }
      ],
      "iconImageBigger": "0",
      "iconImageCaption": "",
      "iconImageOnRight": "0",
      "paragraph": {
        "markup": "<p>By embracing spirituality, one can nurture emotional well-being, manage stress with mindfulness, and navigate relationship challenges with compassion and inner peace.</p>",
        "blocks": {
          "contentData": [],
          "settingsData": []
        }
      },
      "udi": "umb://element/ee90c7187811466196f8cfe0947302f6"
    },
    {
      "backgroundColor": "",
      "backgroundColorOpacity": "1",
      "contentTypeKey": "4ac6dfe6-3e77-4ebb-b1d7-f73ee48847f4",
      "heading": "Nurturing a Life of Purpose",
      "highlightParagraph": "",
      "iconImage": [
        {
          "key": "44a7dc19-6124-49d7-9bd6-add4c4bf27f4",
          "mediaKey": "62d9d575-3964-4f46-8184-97703784718f"
        }
      ],
      "iconImageBigger": "0",
      "iconImageCaption": "",
      "iconImageOnRight": "0",
      "paragraph": {
        "markup": "<p>Align with the actions of one’s deeper values, allowing to live a life full of intention and meaning.</p>",
        "blocks": {
          "contentData": [],
          "settingsData": []
        }
      },
      "udi": "umb://element/2af83a8658c64ebfbd8c9b537496a041"
    },
    {
      "backgroundColor": "",
      "backgroundColorOpacity": "0.250",
      "contentTypeKey": "4ac6dfe6-3e77-4ebb-b1d7-f73ee48847f4",
      "heading": "Spiritual Parenting",
      "highlightParagraph": "",
      "iconImage": [
        {
          "key": "2b29b8a1-dfa7-47f6-b909-9500174fd19d",
          "mediaKey": "ef755cca-a9e7-4fdf-847e-76ea661ce3c9"
        }
      ],
      "iconImageBigger": "0",
      "iconImageCaption": "",
      "iconImageOnRight": "0",
      "paragraph": {
        "markup": "<p>Learn to guide the children with love, patience, and understanding. Discover tools to create an environment that nurtures emotional and spiritual growth, teaching children mindfulness, kindness, and self-love.</p>",
        "blocks": {
          "contentData": [],
          "settingsData": []
        }
      },
      "udi": "umb://element/a43478b912a74788960894a3e93ce1ea"
    },
    {
      "backgroundColor": "",
      "backgroundColorOpacity": "1",
      "contentTypeKey": "4ac6dfe6-3e77-4ebb-b1d7-f73ee48847f4",
      "heading": "Create a Harmonious Home",
      "highlightParagraph": "",
      "iconImage": [
        {
          "key": "3888e356-3963-46e6-b0a2-46c2afdf908a",
          "mediaKey": "e7baab04-75e8-4038-959e-11c8da35f921"
        }
      ],
      "iconImageBigger": "0",
      "iconImageCaption": "",
      "iconImageOnRight": "0",
      "paragraph": {
        "markup": "<p>Discover how incorporating mindfulness and spiritual practices can create a home full of love, calm, and understanding.</p>",
        "blocks": {
          "contentData": [],
          "settingsData": []
        }
      },
      "udi": "umb://element/61f2b59637414c098991027a7fa6bfc6"
    },
    {
      "backgroundColor": {
        "value": "20c997",
        "label": "--bs-teal-rgb",
        "sortOrder": 10,
        "id": "8"
      },
      "backgroundColorOpacity": "0.125",
      "contentTypeKey": "ffb9846c-7933-4578-8bf2-867a66fc6bad",
      "image": [],
      "paragraph": {
        "markup": "<p>BEHF aims to introduce a wide range of programs in future to address diverse needs and promote holistic well-being.</p>",
        "blocks": {
          "contentData": [],
          "settingsData": []
        }
      },
      "udi": "umb://element/9d948a0fdccd4f64b04209868c19e5ca"
    },
    {
      "backgroundColor": "",
      "backgroundColorOpacity": "1",
      "contentTypeKey": "4ac6dfe6-3e77-4ebb-b1d7-f73ee48847f4",
      "heading": "",
      "highlightParagraph": "Our programs are designed with easy-to-implement techniques and practices that can be adapted to both individual and family needs.",
      "iconImage": [],
      "iconImageBigger": "0",
      "iconImageCaption": "",
      "iconImageOnRight": "0",
      "paragraph": "",
      "udi": "umb://element/3c9bdd622f0d402fb8130892f25bf683"
    }
  ],
  "settingsData": [
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "e40dc2c5-e4e4-4641-a53d-e1ffbd5ffb16",
